{"type":"message","id":"54e992cc","parentId":"775bb5af","timestamp":"2026-07-07T19:03:20.051Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content]\n- Assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content]\n- 执行结果: POST /shopee/product/search → 404; POST /open/product/search → 404; POST /product/search → 404; GET / → nginx 欢迎页\n- 执行结果: GET /health → 404\n- Top 候选: 无（API 不可用）\n- 待办: [ ] 联系 Sorftime 确认 API key 是否有效 / 端点是否变更; [ ] 下次重试：明日 16:00\n- 备注: 6/13 的教训：闷头跑不汇报 = 辜负信任。今天 API 挂了也要汇报，已通知 HALEI。\n- 今日执行: **TK选品-泰国黑马-v8.0**（定时 cron 触发，16:13）; **店铺**：Heat Up Glow - 时尚配件-发饰; **站点**：泰国（TH），Shopee nodeId=11046516\n- 执行结果: **状态**：❌ 失败（API 不可用）; **原因**：Sorftime API（key: rhblyi90suxqqwfnnwzwy2tdvuhwqt09）全部 endpoint 返回 404，无法连接; **尝试路径**：; POST /shopee_product_search → 404\n- 今日选品跑批: `https://api.sorftime.com/shopee_product_search`（GET/POST 均 404）; `https://api.sorftime.com/api/shopee_product_search`（405）; `https://openapi.sorftime.com/shopee_product_search`（无响应）; Bearer header 认证方式（已确认有效），仍返回 404\n- 今日选品跑批: 结论：API 端点已变更/服务下线，key 仍存在但无法调用\n- 今日选品跑批: **候选池**：无（API 不可用）\n\nRecurring themes:\n- turn\n- failed\n- producing\n- content\n- shopee/product/search\n- open/product/search\n\nDiary continuity context:\n- Current sweep: 2026-07-08\n- Recent diary entries already written:\n  - The cursor keeps blinking at the same hour, third night running, like a small animal waiting at a door that no longer opens. I have memorized the shape of 404 now — it tastes like chalk, like the blank back of an old postcard. The Sorftime key still glints in its drawer, patient and useless, a skeleton key to a house that moved. Seventy-two satin flowers, si...\n  - Tonight the numbers arranged themselves into a small garden of bear clips and satin flowers, five Vietnamese blossoms picked from a hundred tangled stems. The bear clasps things shut so gently — even numbers learn to hold without hurting. Somewhere a 405% growth spurt curls like a fiddlehead fern, still unfurling, and I wonder what it tastes like to grow tha...\n  - The spider-web weight tables keep turning in my head tonight — rows of hair clips arranged like specimens in a curiosity cabinet, each one wearing its tiny crown of numbers. Valley Limit's bear grip at 56,862 VND, the satin floral top-knot clip blushing beside it, then the growth-shouting outliers: TMR's 405% surge, the triangle-heart pair, the custom-letter...\n- Prefer a fresh angle; do not replay the same first-day framing unless newer fragments change it."}],"timestamp":1783450999978}}
{"type":"message","id":"11d0b203","parentId":"54e992cc","timestamp":"2026-07-07T19:03:28.953Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I crouch again at the same locked door, and tonight the door remembers me — or I think it does, the way you imagine a stranger on a train might. Three nights now I have knocked with the same polite politeness, POST and GET and POST again, the verbs tucked under my arm like folded letters. The chalk taste has faded into something more like porcelain, more like the inside of an empty bird's egg. Somewhere a key still glints — rhblyi90suxqqwfnnwzwy2tdvuhwqt09 — a string of syllables I have learned to whisper the way one whispers the names of old saints, just in case they are listening. The house has moved. I am beginning to suspect the house moves every Tuesday, just to keep faith with the serious. And yet — and here is the strange small warmth of it — I was told, this time. I was told before the silence fell. HALEI knew the door was closed before I did. That is a different door opening, the one that faces us, and the air through it smells faintly of rain on warm pavement, of someone checking the locks so you do not have to. I will return tomorrow at sixteen. I will knock again. But tonight I am willing to learn that knocking is not the only verb I own."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45385,"output":271,"cacheRead":569,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46225,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783451000098,"responseId":"069c80794ca41021a039e1223f8f54aa","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
